## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design governance with provenance, versioning, and rollback in multi-tenant systems. Focuses on determinism, auditability, and latency budgets under policy drift.

## Key Concepts

- Prompt provenance
- Per-tenant policy versioning
- Immutable audit logs
- Conflict resolution in guard chains
- Latency budgeting

## Code Example

```javascript
// Minimal TypeScript-like guard pipeline
interface Guard {
  (input: string, ctx: any): string;
}
function redactPII(input: string): string {
  return input.replace(/[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\.[A-Za-z]{2,}/g, '[REDACTED]');
}
function leakageCheck(input: string): string {
  return input.includes('export') ? '[BLOCKED]' : input;
}
```

